cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "mixed-hailing-taxi-sim: network simulation of mixed-hailing taxi services with human-driven and autonomous taxis"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-28
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/hc-parkkk/mixed-hailing-taxi-sim"
abstract: >-
  A time-driven network simulation of taxi services in which passengers request rides by
  street-hailing or e-hailing and the fleet mixes human-driven taxis (HTs) and autonomous
  taxis (ATs) that serve e-hailing only.
keywords:
  - mixed-hailing
  - heterogeneous fleet
  - e-hailing
  - autonomous taxis
  - simulation
